    <h1>Welcome to Anaya 3D Prints</h1>
    <p class="lead">
        My name is Ayana, which is my mom's last name ("Anaya") spelled
backwards. Because people have accidentlly miscalled me Anaya my entire life, I turned a lifelong
        running joke into the identity of my 3D business.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="container p-5 my-5 bg-dark text-white text-center">
    <h1>Finding Prints Around Albuquerque</h1>
        <p class="lead">
                        You might have found me on TikTok dropping 3D models randomly around the city! Instead of 
            trashing imperfect prints or models that didn’t turn out quite right, I hide them for people 
            to discover. I also don’t believe in profiting off someone else’s creative designs, so leaving 
            them out gives these prints a second life. Whoever finds one is completely free to keep it, 
            gift it, or do whatever they want with it.
        </p>
</div>
